# Hard times as chains (phase 7, the h7_ lines): one tells of a theft, a beating, an arrest, a death, a raid, a
# stranger or a deed, or of their own want; the other answers as they are (crime.answer, loss.answer, road.answer,
# want.answer, stranger.answer, deed.answer: by role, means, traits, age and how they are today); and the first answers
# that in turn (the *.close concepts), knowing how it was taken: each answer tags its stance for the rest of the
# talk (conv.h7_said), and the close is chosen by that stance and the closer's own facts. A chain's later beats
# always take their best tier, so every answer is keyed to the kind of thing it answers (topic.kind, or conv.wn for
# the want openers), and every close to a stance.

############################################################################ Crime: openers (talk.crime: theft, assault, arrest)

rule h7_cr_open_theft
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft
does tell.news
say Have you heard? #topic.victim# was robbed. | #topic.victim#'s been robbed, they're saying. | Somebody had #topic.victim#'s purse. | There's a #thief# about. #topic.victim# found out the hard way. | #topic.victim# came home to #topic.victim_their# things gone.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_assault
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=assault
does tell.news
say #topic.victim# was beaten. In the street. | Somebody set on #topic.victim#. | Did you hear about #topic.victim#? Knocked down and kicked. | They hurt #topic.victim#. Badly, I heard.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_arrest
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=arrest
does tell.news
say #watch.capitalize# took #topic.subject#. | They've put #topic.subject# in #gaol#. | #topic.subject#'s been arrested. #topic.where# took #topic.them#. | Did you see? #topic.subject#, marched off by #watch#.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_guard
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft|assault self.role=guard
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I've been on #topic.victim#'s business all day. Nothing. | If you hear anything about #topic.victim#, you tell me. | We're looking for whoever did #topic.victim#. Seen anyone odd? | Another one for the book. #topic.victim#.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_guard_arrest
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=arrest self.role=guard
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say We brought #topic.subject# in. Didn't go quietly. | #topic.subject#'s in #gaol#. Don't ask me what for. You'll hear. | #topic.where# took #topic.subject#. Clean work, for once. | #topic.subject#'s in the cells and swearing at the walls.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_rich
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft self.wealth=rich
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say What do we pay #watch# for? #topic.victim#, robbed! | I've had the locks changed. After #topic.victim#. All of them. | It'll be someone from outside. It always is. Poor #topic.victim#. | A #thief# in our street. One feels quite exposed.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_poor
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.news
tone serious
cooldown 1d
say #topic.victim#'s been robbed. The Watch'll be looking at folk like me now. | Robbed #topic.victim#? #topic.victim_they.capitalize# had something to rob, then. | Somebody got #topic.victim#. Not me, before you ask. | #topic.victim#'s robbed. Watch everybody look at my paws.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_robbed_too
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft self.robbed=yes
does ask.detail
cooldown 12h
priority 1
say #topic.victim# too? The same lot had me only days ago. | First me, now #topic.victim#. Same #thief#, I'll swear it. | They robbed #topic.victim# as well. Who's next on the list? | #topic.victim#. Like me. Does #watch# even care?
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_nervy
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft|assault self.temper=nervy
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.victim#! That's practically on our doorstep! | I heard about #topic.victim# and I haven't stopped shaking. | What if they come back? For #topic.victim#? For us? | #topic.victim#. I knew it. I knew something would happen.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_old
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft|assault self.stage=old
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.victim#. In my day, the whole street would've chased the #thief# down. | Sixty years in this town and I've never seen it so bad. Poor #topic.victim#. | They got #topic.victim#. Nobody looks out for anyone now. | #topic.victim#. Ah. Forty years ago I'd have had the #thief# by the scruff.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_devout
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft|assault self.piety=devout
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I prayed for #topic.victim# this morning. | Somebody did wrong by #topic.victim#. The Bright One saw it. | #topic.victim#, of all folk. A chapel-goer! | There's wickedness in this town. Look at #topic.victim#.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_dry
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft self.humour=dry
does tell.news
tone serious
cooldown 1d
say Somebody robbed #topic.victim#. I hope they wiped their paws. | #topic.victim#'s been relieved of #topic.victim_their# goods. Very relieving. | A #thief# took #topic.victim#'s things. They'll be disappointed. | #topic.victim# was robbed. At least someone's in work.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_short
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft|assault self.temper=short
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say If I get my paws on whoever did #topic.victim#... | #topic.victim#! In broad day! And #watch# drinking somewhere! | Whoever did #topic.victim# walks about free. It makes my blood boil. | #topic.victim#. I'm so angry I could bite something.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_sump
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft|assault here.region=ridgemere self.quarter=sump
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.victim#'s been done. #watch.capitalize#'ll be down here looking by noon. | They'll blame the Sump for #topic.victim#. Watch. | Not one of ours did #topic.victim#. We'd have heard. | #watch# will kick in a few Sump doors over #topic.victim#. Ours first.
then other: crime.answer

rule h7_cr_open_someone
when concept=talk.crime topic.kind=theft topic.subject=someone self.honesty=sly
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say Nobody saw a thing, with #topic.victim#. Funny, that. | Robbed, and not a whisker seen. Somebody's good. | #topic.victim#'s things walked off by themselves, it seems. | Whoever did #topic.victim# is better at it than most. I'd almost admire it.
then other: crime.answer

############################################################################ Crime: answers (self is the one answering)

rule h7_cr_ans_any
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault
does react.news
say {h7_said=sorry} Bright One. Poor #topic.victim#. | {h7_said=sorry} That's a bad business. | {h7_said=sorry} I heard. It's everywhere. | {h7_said=sorry} Nobody's safe any more. | {h7_said=sorry} And in daylight, too, I'll bet.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_any_arrest
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=arrest
does react.news
say {h7_said=shrug} Well. That's them done for. | {h7_said=shrug} I'd not want to be #topic.subject# tonight. | {h7_said=shrug} So they caught someone, for once. | {h7_said=shrug} There's always more to it than you hear.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_guard
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.role=guard
does react.news
say {h7_said=duty} We're on it. We're always on it. | {h7_said=duty} I've been asking all morning. Nobody saw a thing. They never do. | {h7_said=duty} Leave it with #watch#. Don't go playing guard yourself. | {h7_said=duty} If anyone knows anything, tell me. I'll keep your name out.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_guard_arrest
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=arrest self.role=guard
does react.news
say {h7_said=duty_arrest} And they'll stay there till the magistrate's had a look. | {h7_said=duty_arrest} I held the door. They bit #topic.where#. | {h7_said=duty_arrest} Don't feel sorry for them. You don't know what they did. | {h7_said=duty_arrest} That's one. There's more.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_rich
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.wealth=rich
does react.news
say {h7_said=hang} Flog them, when they're caught. In the square. | {h7_said=hang} They should hang a few. The rest would learn. | {h7_said=hang} I'll have a wolf on the gate from now on. Two wolves. | {h7_said=hang} One pays a fortune in levies for this?
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_rich_arrest
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=arrest self.wealth=rich
does react.news
say {h7_said=hang} Good. Let them make an example. | {h7_said=hang} One hopes the magistrate isn't soft. | {h7_said=hang} Splendid. The streets feel safer already. | {h7_said=hang} Keep them in. Keep them all in.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_poor
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.news
say {h7_said=pity} Hungry, I'd bet. Whoever did it. | {h7_said=pity} I can't say I blame them. Don't look at me like that. | {h7_said=pity} When a wolf's starving, a purse looks like supper. | {h7_said=pity} Robbing the comfortable. Some would call it sharing.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_poor_arrest
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=arrest self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.news
say {h7_said=pity_arrest} Poor sod. There'll be nobody to speak up for them. | {h7_said=pity_arrest} The rich steal more and nobody takes them. | {h7_said=pity_arrest} Somebody'll go hungry with them in #gaol#. | {h7_said=pity_arrest} They take our sort. Never theirs.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_hungry
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft self.wealth=poor|destitute self.hungry=yes
does react.news
say {h7_said=pity} I've thought about it. Don't tell anyone. I've thought about it. | {h7_said=pity} My belly says good luck to them. My head says shame. | {h7_said=pity} If they took bread, I'd hold the door. | {h7_said=pity} I'm too hungry to be shocked.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_short
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.temper=short
does react.news
say {h7_said=hang} Let me find them. Just let me. | {h7_said=hang} String them up. I'll bring the rope. | {h7_said=hang} And #watch# sitting on their tails! | {h7_said=hang} That makes me want to break something.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_nervy
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.temper=nervy
does react.news
say {h7_said=fear} Don't. I'll not sleep now. | {h7_said=fear} Was it near here? How near? | {h7_said=fear} I knew it. I knew it'd come to this. | {h7_said=fear} Oh, Bright One. Oh, Bright One. My door doesn't even lock properly.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_robbed
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft self.robbed=yes
does react.news
priority 1
say {h7_said=same} Same as me. Same as me! | {h7_said=same} Join the club. Nobody wants to be in it. | {h7_said=same} Now will #watch# listen? Now? | {h7_said=same} I know just how they feel. Sick. Sick and stupid.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_devout
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.piety=devout
does react.news
say {h7_said=pray} I'll pray for #topic.victim#. And for whoever did it. | {h7_said=pray} The Bright One will settle it. In good time. | {h7_said=pray} There's a wolf out there with a heavy soul tonight. | {h7_said=pray} I'll light a candle for #topic.victim# on Restday.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_devout_arrest
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=arrest self.piety=devout
does react.news
say {h7_said=pray} I'll pray they repent in there. | {h7_said=pray} The Bright One forgives. Magistrates don't. | {h7_said=pray} Somebody should take them a blessing, at least. | {h7_said=pray} We're all a step from #gaol#, if the Bright One looks away.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_dry
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft self.humour=dry
does react.news
say {h7_said=joke} Robbing #topic.victim#. That's ambition. | {h7_said=joke} Well, it's one way to share the wealth. | {h7_said=joke} Lucky #thief#. I've been trying to get rid of my things for years. | {h7_said=joke} I'll put a sign on my door. Nothing worth it here.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_merry
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft self.humour=merry
does react.news
say {h7_said=joke} Well. I hope they took the ugly chair too. | {h7_said=joke} Somebody's having a grand day. Not #topic.victim#. | {h7_said=joke} Oh, no. Oh, that's terrible. Did they take the goose? | {h7_said=joke} Sorry. Sorry. It's not funny. It's a bit funny.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_merry_arrest
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=arrest self.humour=merry
does react.news
say {h7_said=joke} Ha! Somebody's having a worse day than me, then. | {h7_said=joke} Free bed and board. There's worse ways to spend a week. | {h7_said=joke} Ha. I'll bet they went kicking.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_warm
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.warmth=warm
does react.news
say {h7_said=care} Is #topic.victim# all right? Should we go round? | {h7_said=care} I'll take them something. Soup. | {h7_said=care} Poor #topic.victim#. #topic.victim_they.capitalize#'ll need folk about #topic.victim_them#. | {h7_said=care} Has anyone sat with #topic.victim#?
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_cold
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.warmth=cold
does react.news
say {h7_said=cold} Should've locked #topic.victim_their# door. | {h7_said=cold} Happens. | {h7_said=cold} Not my business. | {h7_said=cold} They'll live.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_old
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.stage=old
does react.news
tone serious
say {h7_said=past} In my day we'd have known who it was by supper. | {h7_said=past} There was a wolf like that when I was a pup. Hanged at the crossroads. | {h7_said=past} It's always been so. You just hear it more now. | {h7_said=past} I've been robbed three times in my life. You get over it. Mostly.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_young
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.stage=young
does react.news ask.detail
say {h7_said=pup} Will they come to our house? | {h7_said=pup} I'd bite them! Right on the tail! | {h7_said=pup} Is #topic.victim# all right? | {h7_said=pup} Why did they do it?
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_young_arrest
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=arrest self.stage=young
does react.news ask.detail
say {h7_said=pup} Will they put them in a cage? | {h7_said=pup} Did they fight? I'd have fought. | {h7_said=pup} Can I go and look at #gaol#?
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_sly
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft self.honesty=sly
does react.news
say {h7_said=sly} Hm. Wonder where they'll sell it. | {h7_said=sly} Clever. Nobody saw? Very clever. | {h7_said=sly} What did they get, do you know? Exactly? | {h7_said=sly} #topic.victim# had a lot more than #topic.victim_they# let on, then.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_merchant
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft self.role=merchant
does react.news
say {h7_said=fear} A stall's next. Mark me. | {h7_said=fear} I'll be sleeping on my stock. | {h7_said=fear} Thieves are worse than bad weather for trade. | {h7_said=fear} I've lost more to light paws than to bad debts.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_healer
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=assault self.job=healer
does react.news
say {h7_said=mend} I was up with #topic.victim# half the night. | {h7_said=mend} I've seen to them. They'll mend. Slowly. | {h7_said=mend} Whoever did it knew where to kick. | {h7_said=mend} I'll go back this evening. They're not to get up.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_mourning
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault self.mourning=kin|friend
does react.news
priority 1
say {h7_said=grief} I can't think about it. Not this week. | {h7_said=grief} Everything's bad news this week. | {h7_said=grief} I've no room left for more sorrow. | {h7_said=grief} Things. They're only things. I know that now.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_sump
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft|assault here.region=ridgemere self.quarter=sump
does react.news
say {h7_said=blame} And they'll blame us. Watch them. | {h7_said=blame} Not one of ours. We'd have heard. | Up the hill, that's news. Down here it's the weather. | {h7_said=blame} They'll come kicking our doors in for it.
then other: crime.close

rule h7_cr_ans_heights
when concept=crime.answer topic.kind=theft here.region=ridgemere self.quarter=heights self.wealth=rich|comfortable
does react.news
say {h7_said=hang} One will speak to the captain. Personally. | {h7_said=hang} Was it someone from below, do they think? | {h7_said=hang} Dreadful. One's own servants, quite possibly. | {h7_said=hang} The city's going to ruin.
then other: crime.close

############################################################################ Crime: closes (self opened; conv.h7_said says how it was taken)

rule h7_cr_close_any
when concept=crime.close
does assess
say Aye. Well. | Bad times. | Keep your door shut. | Mind how you go.

rule h7_cr_close_sorry
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=sorry
does assess
say Aye. Bad business. | It could be any of us. | I'll go round later. | #bc_poor_soul#

rule h7_cr_close_shrug
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=shrug
does assess
say Aye. | We'll hear soon enough. | Hm. We'll see. | So it goes.

rule h7_cr_close_duty
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=duty
does assess
say I'll keep my ears open. | Find them, then. | You always say that. | Do. Please.

rule h7_cr_close_duty_short
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=duty self.temper=short
does assess
say On it? You're stood here talking to me. | Then get off it and find them. | Leave it with you? I'd sooner leave it with the cat.

rule h7_cr_close_duty_arrest
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=duty_arrest
does assess
say Good. Keep them there. | Well done, then. | Was it them, though, truly? | I'll sleep easier.

rule h7_cr_close_hang
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=hang
does assess
say Hanging's a hard cure. | Hanging won't mend anything. | Steady. | That's strong.

rule h7_cr_close_hang_poor
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=hang self.wealth=poor|destitute
does assess
say Easy said from a full belly. | And when it's a hungry pup? Hang them too? | They'd hang me for less. | You'd want the rope for half this street.

rule h7_cr_close_hang_devout
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=hang self.piety=devout
does assess
say The Bright One judges. Not us. | That's not justice. That's anger. | Pray on that before you say it again.

rule h7_cr_close_pity
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=pity
does assess
say Hungry's no excuse. | Don't let #watch# hear you say that. | Maybe. Still wrong. | I suppose. I suppose.

rule h7_cr_close_pity_rich
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=pity|pity_arrest self.wealth=rich
does assess
say There's always honest work. | That's dangerous talk. | Then they should apply to the parish. | One gives to the chapel for exactly this.

rule h7_cr_close_pity_poor
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=pity|pity_arrest self.wealth=poor|destitute
does assess
say Aye. It's not hard to see how. | I know. Bright One, I know. | We've all stood at that door. | Hush. But aye.

rule h7_cr_close_pity_arrest
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=pity_arrest
does assess
say Maybe. Still, the law's the law. | Aye. It's always our sort. | They did something, though. They must have.

rule h7_cr_close_fear
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=fear
does assess
say Bolt the door and you'll be fine. | Don't fret. Lightning doesn't strike twice. | Stay with us tonight, if you like. | It'll pass. These things pass.

rule h7_cr_close_fear_dry
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=fear self.humour=dry
does assess
say Cheer up. They'll probably rob someone richer. | You're safe. You've nothing anyone wants. | Sleep with a pan by the bed. Hit anything that moves. Except me.

rule h7_cr_close_same
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=same
does assess
say Then you know. | Did they ever find yours? | Bright One, I'd forgotten. I'm sorry. | We should go to #watch# together.

rule h7_cr_close_pray
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=pray
does assess
say Pray for me while you're at it. | If the Bright One is listening. | Aye. And for all of us. | Prayers are well and good. A bolt's better.

rule h7_cr_close_joke
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=joke
does assess
say That's not funny. | Ha. Don't. | You're terrible. | Wicked. Wicked and right.

rule h7_cr_close_joke_short
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=joke self.temper=short
does assess
say It's not a joke. | Laugh, then. Laugh when it's you. | I don't find that funny at all.

rule h7_cr_close_care
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=care
does assess
say I'll come with you. | That's kind. Take bread, too. | Let's go round this evening. | You're a good soul.

rule h7_cr_close_care_cold
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=care self.warmth=cold
does assess
say Do what you like. | They've family for that. | Suit yourself.

rule h7_cr_close_cold
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=cold
does assess
say That's hard, even for you. | Hm. Charming. | I'll remember that, when it's your door.

rule h7_cr_close_past
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=past
does assess
say Times change. | Maybe so. | Things were simpler then, I suppose.

rule h7_cr_close_pup
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=pup
does assess
say They'll be all right. Don't you fret. | Hush, now. Nobody's coming to ours. | No biting anybody, mind. | Never you mind. Run along.

rule h7_cr_close_sly
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=sly
does assess
say You'd know, would you? | I don't like the way you said that. | Funny thing to ask. | Hm. I'll keep my purse closer.

rule h7_cr_close_mend
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=mend
does assess
say Thank the Bright One you were there. | Give them my best. | You're a good sort.

rule h7_cr_close_grief
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=grief
does assess
say Of course. Forgive me. | I'm sorry. I forgot. | I shouldn't have said. Not this week.

rule h7_cr_close_blame
when concept=crime.close conv.h7_said=blame
does assess
say Nobody's blaming you. | They'll not, this time. | Aye. They always do.

############################################################################ Loss: openers (talk.life, a death in town; talk.news, one's own)

rule h7_ls_open
when concept=talk.life topic.kind=death
does tell.news
say #topic.subject# died. | The bell was for #topic.subject#. | #topic.subject#'s gone. Last night. | #topic.subject#'s to be buried tomorrow. | Did you hear about #topic.subject#? Gone.
then other: loss.answer

rule h7_ls_open_old
when concept=talk.life topic.kind=death self.stage=old
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject#. I knew #topic.them# when #topic.they# was a pup. | Another one. They keep going before me. | #topic.subject#'s gone. I remember #topic.them# at #topic.their# first festival. | That's #topic.subject# gone. I'll be next, mark me.
then other: loss.answer

rule h7_ls_open_priest
when concept=talk.life topic.kind=death self.job=priest
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I'll say the words over #topic.subject# tomorrow. | I was with #topic.subject# at the last. | #topic.subject# is with the Bright One now. | I've #topic.subject#'s burial and two more this week.
then other: loss.answer

rule h7_ls_open_mourning
when concept=talk.life topic.kind=death self.mourning=kin|friend
does tell.news
cooldown 12h
priority 1
say And #topic.subject# now too. I can't. | Another one. As if this week weren't enough. | #topic.subject#. I've only just stopped crying. | Everyone's going. Everyone.
then other: loss.answer

rule h7_ls_open_dry
when concept=talk.life topic.kind=death self.humour=dry self.mourning=no
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject#'s died. Owed me a penny, too. I'll let it go. | #topic.subject#. Gone and missed the rent day. Clever. | They're burying #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize#'d have hated the fuss. | #topic.subject# never could stand a queue. Went early.
then other: loss.answer

rule h7_ls_open_poor
when concept=talk.life topic.kind=death self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject#'s gone, and nothing to bury them with. | #topic.subject#. The parish'll do it. Plain box. | They'll put #topic.subject# in the paupers' row. Same as we'll go. | #topic.subject# died. Cold and an empty pot, I'd bet.
then other: loss.answer

rule h7_ls_open_news
when concept=talk.news topic.kind=loss
does tell.self
tone grave
priority 1
say I've lost someone. This week. | We buried one of ours. I keep thinking I'll see them. | I've had bad news. The worst sort. | You'll hear it anyway. We've had a death.
then other: loss.answer

############################################################################ Loss: answers (topic.kind=death, someone in town; topic.kind=loss, the teller's own)

rule h7_ls_ans_any
when concept=loss.answer
does sympathise
say {h7_said=sorry} Ah, no. | {h7_said=sorry} That's hard news. | {h7_said=sorry} I hadn't heard. I'm sorry. | {h7_said=sorry} Rest them.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_own
when concept=loss.answer topic.kind=loss
does sympathise
say {h7_said=sorry} Oh, I'm so sorry. | {h7_said=sorry} I'd no idea. I'm so sorry. | {h7_said=sorry} That's hard. Bright One, that's hard. | {h7_said=sorry} Is there anything I can do?
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_warm
when concept=loss.answer topic.kind=loss self.warmth=warm
does sympathise
say {h7_said=care} Oh, #pet#. Come here. | {h7_said=care} I'll bring food round. Don't argue. | {h7_said=care} Whatever you need. Anything. | {h7_said=care} I'm so sorry. Sit with me a while.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_warm_death
when concept=loss.answer topic.kind=death self.warmth=warm
does sympathise
say {h7_said=kind} Oh, their poor family. I'll take something round. | {h7_said=kind} Who's seeing to the family? | {h7_said=kind} I'll sit with them tonight, if they'd like.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_cold
when concept=loss.answer self.warmth=cold
does sympathise
say {h7_said=cold} Everyone goes. | {h7_said=cold} Mm. These things happen. | {h7_said=cold} Well. That's that.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_cold_death
when concept=loss.answer topic.kind=death self.warmth=cold
does sympathise
say {h7_said=cold} Hardly knew them. | {h7_said=cold} Everyone goes. | {h7_said=cold} Mm.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_devout
when concept=loss.answer self.piety=devout
does sympathise
say {h7_said=pray} They're with the Bright One now. | {h7_said=pray} I'll pray for them tonight. | {h7_said=pray} The Bright One keep them. | {h7_said=pray} There's a light gone out, and another lit somewhere.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_old
when concept=loss.answer self.stage=old
does sympathise
say {h7_said=old} They go so fast now. One a season. | {h7_said=old} I've buried more friends than I have left. | {h7_said=old} At my age you stop counting. You don't stop missing. | {h7_said=old} Gone before me. That's not the right order.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_young
when concept=loss.answer self.stage=young
does sympathise ask.detail
say {h7_said=young} Are they coming back? | {h7_said=young} Will they be cold in #grave#? | {h7_said=young} Is that why everyone's sad? | {h7_said=young} I don't want anyone to die.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_dry
when concept=loss.answer topic.kind=death self.humour=dry other.mourning=no
does sympathise
say {h7_said=joke} Well. They always said they'd go first. | {h7_said=joke} Gone to a better place. Couldn't be much worse than here. | {h7_said=joke} Lucky them. No more winters. | {h7_said=joke} Death and levies, and they've beaten the levies.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_poor
when concept=loss.answer topic.kind=death self.wealth=poor|destitute
does sympathise
say {h7_said=poor} Who'll pay for the burying? | {h7_said=poor} At least they're warm now. Wherever they are. | {h7_said=poor} One less mouth, they'll say at the big houses. | {h7_said=poor} It's always our sort that go first.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_mourning
when concept=loss.answer self.mourning=kin|friend
does sympathise
priority 1
say {h7_said=grief} Not another. I can't hold another. | {h7_said=grief} I know how it sits. Bright One, I know. | {h7_said=grief} I've no tears left. I'm sorry. | {h7_said=grief} We're all burying someone this season.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_widowed
when concept=loss.answer topic.kind=loss self.widowed=yes
does sympathise
say {h7_said=grief} It doesn't get easier. It gets quieter. | {h7_said=grief} You'll talk to them. Everyone does. | {h7_said=grief} I still set two cups. Don't tell anyone. | {h7_said=grief} The first winter's the worst.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_short
when concept=loss.answer self.temper=short
does sympathise
say {h7_said=angry} Why do the good ones go? Why? | {h7_said=angry} It's not fair. None of it's fair. | {h7_said=angry} Don't. I'll hit a wall. | {h7_said=angry} Dark One take it.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_priest
when concept=loss.answer self.job=priest
does sympathise
say {h7_said=pray} I'll say the words. Good words. | {h7_said=pray} Come to the chapel, after. We'll light one together. | {h7_said=pray} Grief is love with nowhere to go. Give it somewhere. | {h7_said=pray} They were loved. That's what I'll say, because it's true.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_healer
when concept=loss.answer topic.kind=death self.job=healer
does sympathise
say {h7_said=healer} I should've been called sooner. | {h7_said=healer} I did what I could. It wasn't enough. | {h7_said=healer} There was nothing in the jar for that. | {h7_said=healer} I'll not sleep tonight.
then other: loss.close

rule h7_ls_ans_rich
when concept=loss.answer self.wealth=rich
does sympathise
say {h7_said=rich} How dreadful. I'll send something. | {h7_said=rich} One must pay one's respects. | {h7_said=rich} I'll see the stone's paid for. | {h7_said=rich} Such a shame. Did they leave the family anything?
then other: loss.close

############################################################################ Loss: closes

rule h7_ls_close_any
when concept=loss.close
does ack
say Aye. | #bc_thank_you# | It's a hard week. | Rest them.

rule h7_ls_close_care
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=care
does ack
say Thank you. Truly. | You're good to me. | I'd like that. | I'll not argue. Not today.

rule h7_ls_close_kind
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=kind
does ack
say That's good of you. | They'd be glad of it. | I'll come with you.

rule h7_ls_close_cold
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=cold
does ack
say Is that all? | Well, I knew them. | Bright One, you're a stone. | Thank you for nothing.

rule h7_ls_close_pray
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=pray
does ack
say Say one for me too. | #bc_i_hope_so# | If anyone's listening. | Thank you. That helps. A little.

rule h7_ls_close_pray_short
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=pray self.piety=ordinary self.temper=short
does ack
say The Bright One took them. Much good the light does me. | Pray if you like. I'll drink. | Don't tell me about the Bright One today.

rule h7_ls_close_old
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=old
does ack
say Don't you go anywhere. | You'll outlast us all. | Then tell me about them. The old ones. | Aye. You've seen more of it than most.

rule h7_ls_close_young
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=young
does ack
say Hush, pup. Come here. | It's sad, pup. That's all. It's just sad. | You'll understand when you're older. Come here. | It's all right. It's all right.

rule h7_ls_close_joke
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=joke
does ack
say Ha. They'd have laughed at that. | Don't. I'll laugh at the burial. | That's dreadful. Say it again. | You're awful.

rule h7_ls_close_poor
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=poor
does ack
say We'll pass a hat. | The parish, I suppose. | Aye. It's always us. | We'll go the same way.

rule h7_ls_close_angry
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=angry
does ack
say I know. I know. | Hit the wall, then. I'll hold your coat. | Curse it with you. | Aye. Curse it.

rule h7_ls_close_rich
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=rich
does ack
say That's... generous. | Send bread, not flowers. They'll need feeding. | Aye. Well. Thank you.

rule h7_ls_close_grief
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=grief
does ack
say I know. I'm sorry. | We'll get through it. Somehow. | Come here. Both of us, then.

rule h7_ls_close_healer
when concept=loss.close conv.h7_said=healer
does ack
say It's not your fault. | You did all anyone could. | Nobody blames you.

############################################################################ The road: openers (talk.bandits, talk.caravan raided)

rule h7_rd_open
when concept=talk.bandits topic.kind=raided
does tell.news
tone serious
say #bandits.capitalize# again. They had the #topic.where# carts. | The road to #topic.where#'s been robbed again. | They raided a caravan out of #topic.where#. | Nothing's coming from #topic.where# this week. Robbed.
then other: road.answer

rule h7_rd_open_camp
when concept=talk.bandits topic.kind=camp
does tell.news
say There's a camp out by #topic.where#. #bandits.capitalize#. | Somebody saw fires out by #topic.where#. | They're camped out by #topic.where#, bold as you like. | Stay off the road past #topic.where#.
then other: road.answer

# A camp one has heard of (doc 84, Phase 1: the claim in its own words, claims.json's bandits.camp and bandits.robs, where
# it was told as gossip with the camp's id before).
rule h7_rd_open_camp_heard
when concept=talk.bandits topic.kind=camp topic.said
does tell.news
say Word off the road: #topic.said#. | Did you hear? #topic.said.capitalize#. | They're saying #topic.said#. I'll not be going that way. | #topic.said.capitalize#, so they say. Keep to the town.
then other: road.answer

rule h7_rd_open_camp_heard_merchant
when concept=talk.bandits topic.kind=camp topic.said self.role=merchant
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say I had it over the counter: #topic.said#. There goes my next order. | #topic.said.capitalize#. I'll pay more for every crate that gets through. | Nobody's sending wagons while #topic.said#.
then other: road.answer

rule h7_rd_open_camp_heard_guard
when concept=talk.bandits topic.kind=camp topic.said self.role=guard
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say It came to the watch post: #topic.said#. | We've word #topic.said#. Nobody's riding out yet. | #topic.said.capitalize#. The captain says it's not ours to clear.
then other: road.answer

rule h7_rd_open_caravan
when concept=talk.caravan topic.kind=raided
does tell.news
say The #topic.where# caravan never made it. | They hit the carts from #topic.where#. | We'll get nothing from #topic.where# this week. | Robbed. The whole #topic.where# run.
then other: road.answer

rule h7_rd_open_merchant
when concept=talk.bandits|talk.caravan topic.kind=raided self.role=merchant
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say There goes my stock. On the #topic.where# road. | That was my order on those carts. | I'll have nothing to sell by market day. | Another raid. I'll have to put the prices up.
then other: road.answer

rule h7_rd_open_travelling
when concept=talk.bandits topic.kind=raided|camp self.travelling=yes
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
priority 1
say I'm on that road tomorrow. That very road. | I've to go out past #topic.where#. Bright One help me. | I'd hoped to be away by dawn. Now I don't know. | Is there another way? Any other way?
then other: road.answer

rule h7_rd_open_guard
when concept=talk.bandits topic.kind=raided|camp self.role=guard
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say They want riders for #topic.where#. Volunteers. | Captain says we're not to go past the milestones. Whatever happens. | We've twelve wolves and a lame horse. Against that. | I'd go after them. If they let me.
then other: road.answer

rule h7_rd_open_poor
when concept=talk.bandits|talk.caravan topic.kind=raided self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
tone serious
cooldown 1d
say They robbed the carts. Bread'll be dear again. | Robbers took the #topic.where# load. Guess who pays. | The rich lose a cart, we lose supper. | Another raid. Another penny on the loaf.
then other: road.answer

############################################################################ The road: answers

rule h7_rd_ans_any
when concept=road.answer
does react.news
say {h7_said=shrug} Not again. | {h7_said=shrug} Bright One keep the carters. | {h7_said=shrug} It's getting worse. | {h7_said=shrug} The roads were never safe. | {h7_said=shrug} Somebody ought to do something.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_guard
when concept=road.answer self.role=guard
does react.news
say {h7_said=duty} We can't be everywhere. | {h7_said=duty} The road's not ours. The walls are. | {h7_said=duty} Give us horses and we'll ride. | {h7_said=duty} I'd go. Tonight. If the captain let me.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_merchant
when concept=road.answer self.role=merchant
does react.news
say {h7_said=trade} Then prices go up. Don't look at me. | {h7_said=trade} I'll be selling turnips and hope. | {h7_said=trade} Guards cost more than goods, now. | {h7_said=trade} My next order's sitting in a yard somewhere, too frightened to move.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_carter
when concept=road.answer self.job=carter
does react.news
say {h7_said=fear_road} I'll not drive that road. Not for double. | {h7_said=fear_road} I know those carters. I'll go and see them. | {h7_said=fear_road} That's my road. That's my road! | {h7_said=fear_road} Next run's mine. Bright One.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_travelling
when concept=road.answer self.travelling=yes
does react.news
priority 1
say {h7_said=fear_road} And I've to go out there. | {h7_said=fear_road} Don't tell me that. I leave at dawn. | {h7_said=fear_road} Then I'm walking with the carts. Close. | {h7_said=fear_road} I'll go the long way. Three days more.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_poor
when concept=road.answer self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.news
say {h7_said=poor} Nothing of mine on it. I'll sleep sound. | {h7_said=poor} They'll put the price of it on our bread. | {h7_said=poor} Robbers robbing the rich. Hard to cry. | {h7_said=poor} Let the Houses guard their own carts.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_rich
when concept=road.answer self.wealth=rich
does react.news
say {h7_said=rich} Someone must raise a troop. One would contribute. | {h7_said=rich} It's the Houses' business. Let them see to it. | {h7_said=rich} How tiresome. There was wine on that cart. | {h7_said=rich} One's agent will have to find another way.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_nervy
when concept=road.answer self.temper=nervy
does react.news
say {h7_said=fear} What if they come here? Into town? | {h7_said=fear} I knew it. I knew it was coming. | {h7_said=fear} Don't. I'll dream about it. | {h7_said=fear} They're getting closer. Aren't they?
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_short
when concept=road.answer self.temper=short
does react.news
say {h7_said=fight} Give me a spear and twelve good wolves. | {h7_said=fight} Burn them out. That's all they understand. | {h7_said=fight} And #watch# sitting on the walls! | {h7_said=fight} I'm sick of it. Sick of it!
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_old
when concept=road.answer self.stage=old
does react.news
tone serious
say {h7_said=old} In my day we hanged them at the crossroads. | {h7_said=old} It was worse when I was young. Truly. | {h7_said=old} Bandits come and go, like the weather. | {h7_said=old} They'll move on in the spring. They always do.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_devout
when concept=road.answer self.piety=devout
does react.news
say {h7_said=pray} I'll pray for the carters. | {h7_said=pray} Bright One keep the road. | {h7_said=pray} We'll pray for them on Restday. All of us. | {h7_said=pray} There's evil on the roads this season.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_ambitious
when concept=road.answer self.drive=ambitious|restless self.stage=adult
does react.news
say {h7_said=chance} Someone's going to make good money guarding carts. | {h7_said=chance} Whoever clears that road will be a name. | {h7_said=chance} I'd go. With the right pay. | {h7_said=chance} That's a chance, if you look at it right.
then other: road.close

rule h7_rd_ans_dry
when concept=road.answer self.humour=dry
does react.news
say {h7_said=joke} Good. Fewer carts, less traffic. | {h7_said=joke} They'll be wanting a stall at the market next. | {h7_said=joke} Somebody's trade is booming, then. | {h7_said=joke} At least they're working.
then other: road.close

############################################################################ The road: closes

rule h7_rd_close_any
when concept=road.close
does ack
say Aye. Bad times. | Bright One keep them. | Let's hope it passes. | #bc_we_will_see#

rule h7_rd_close_duty
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=duty
does ack
say Then what are you for? | So we sit and wait. | Ask again. Ask louder. | Walls don't feed us.

rule h7_rd_close_trade
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=trade
does ack
say You'd put them up anyway. | Lovely. Dearer everything. | Then we go without. Again. | Blame the road. Always the road.

rule h7_rd_close_fear_road
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=fear_road
does ack
say Go in daylight. All of it. | Go with others. Never alone. | Bright One keep you. | Stay, if you can.

rule h7_rd_close_fear
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=fear
does ack
say They'll not come here. Not with the walls. | Calm yourself. They're miles off. | Bolt your door, if it helps.

rule h7_rd_close_poor
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=poor
does ack
say It's not the Houses who'll go hungry. | Aye. Sound sleep's the one thing we've got. | Ha. Fair. | And who pays? We do.

rule h7_rd_close_rich
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=rich
does ack
say Wine. Bright One help us. | Raise one, then. You've the coin. | The carters had pups, you know. | Tiresome. Aye.

rule h7_rd_close_fight
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=fight
does ack
say And who'd follow you? | Twelve wolves. Name eleven. | Burn and be burnt. | Calm yourself.

rule h7_rd_close_old
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=old
does ack
say Maybe so. | I hope you're right. | Times change, and not for the better.

rule h7_rd_close_pray
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=pray
does ack
say Pray harder. | And a spear, with the prayer. | Pray they come home. | Aye. Bright One keep them.

rule h7_rd_close_chance
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=chance
does ack
say A chance to die. | Go on, then. I'll watch. | Big talk. | Someone will. Not you.

rule h7_rd_close_joke
when concept=road.close conv.h7_said=joke
does ack
say That's grim. | Ha. Don't. | You'd joke at your own wake. | Very funny.

############################################################################ Want: openers (one in want tells or asks; conv.wn says what)

rule h7_wn_open_loan
when concept=talk.friends|talk.smalltalk self.wealth=destitute other.wealth=comfortable|rich pair.band=friends|family|acquaintances self.stage=adult|old
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 3d
say {wn=loan} I hate to ask. Could you lend me a little? | {wn=loan} Just till Restday. A few pennies. I'll pay it back. | {wn=loan} I'm short. Very short. Could you see your way? | {wn=loan} I've never asked you for anything. I'm asking now.
then other: want.answer

rule h7_wn_open_hungry
when concept=talk.friends|talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.hungry=yes self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {wn=hungry} I've not eaten since yesterday morning. | {wn=hungry} You've not got a crust? Anything? | {wn=hungry} I'm that hungry I could eat the cobbles. | {wn=hungry} Is it wrong to steal bread? Asking for a friend. The friend is me.
then other: want.answer

rule h7_wn_open_dole
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.on_dole=yes self.stage=adult|old
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {wn=dole} I'm on #dole# now. You'll have seen me in the line. | {wn=dole} Two hours for the parish loaf, and it was yesterday's. | {wn=dole} Never thought I'd queue for bread. | {wn=dole} The priest knows my name now. From the line.
then other: want.answer

rule h7_wn_open_owes
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends self.owes=yes self.stage=adult|old
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {wn=owes} The lender came round. With a friend. A big friend. | {wn=owes} I owe more than I own. Don't tell anyone. | {wn=owes} I can't pay. I can't. What do I do? | {wn=owes} If I go missing, the lender's had me.
then other: want.answer

rule h7_wn_open_homeless
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.friends|talk.day self.homeless=yes
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
priority 1
say {wn=homeless} I've nowhere to sleep tonight. | {wn=homeless} They put my things out in the street. | {wn=homeless} I've been sleeping in the market. Under a stall. | {wn=homeless} You've not got a corner? A floor? Anything?
then other: want.answer

rule h7_wn_open_failing
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.work self.business=failing self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
priority 1
say {wn=failing} The business is finished. I'll be selling the shelves next. | {wn=failing} Nobody's buying, and the rent's due. | {wn=failing} I've stock rotting and no coin for bread. | {wn=failing} I'll be on #dole# by the month's end. Me. With a trade.
then other: want.answer

rule h7_wn_open_hurt
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day|talk.friends self.injured=bad self.stage=adult|old
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 12h
say {wn=hurt} I can't work like this. And if I don't work, I don't eat. | {wn=hurt} Look at my arm. How do I lift a sack with that? | {wn=hurt} The healer wants paying. With what? | {wn=hurt} I'll lose my place if I'm off a week.
then other: want.answer

rule h7_wn_open_robbed
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day|talk.friends self.robbed=yes self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 12h
priority 1
say {wn=robbed} They took the little I had. All of it. | {wn=robbed} Robbed. And I'd nothing to start with. | {wn=robbed} The rent was in that purse. The rent! | {wn=robbed} Whoever took it, I hope they choke on it.
then other: want.answer

rule h7_wn_open_old_poor
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.day self.stage=old self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {wn=old} A lifetime's work and nothing to show. Nothing. | {wn=old} I'm too old for the work and too young to die. | {wn=old} My pups are grown and gone, and the pot's empty. | {wn=old} When I can't work, I'll go to the chapel steps. That's all there is.
then other: want.answer

rule h7_wn_open_parent
when concept=talk.smalltalk|talk.family|talk.friends self.parent=yes self.age<=45 self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {wn=pups} The pups went to bed hungry again. | {wn=pups} I gave mine my supper. They didn't know. | {wn=pups} How do you tell a pup there's no more? | {wn=pups} My little one asked why we're poor. I'd no answer.
then other: want.answer

############################################################################ Want: answers (self is the one answering)

rule h7_wn_ans_any
when concept=want.answer
does give.advice
say {h7_said=sorry} I'm sorry. Truly. | {h7_said=sorry} That's hard. | {h7_said=sorry} Bright One. What'll you do? | {h7_said=sorry} It'll turn. It has to. | {h7_said=sorry} That's no way to live.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_rich_warm
when concept=want.answer self.wealth=rich|comfortable self.warmth=warm
does give.advice
say {h7_said=give} Here. Take this. No, don't count it. | {h7_said=give} Come and eat with us tonight. And tomorrow. | {h7_said=give} I'll see you right. Don't argue with me. | {h7_said=give} How much do you need? Tell me true.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_rich_cold
when concept=want.answer self.wealth=rich self.warmth=cold
does give.advice
say {h7_said=refuse} I'm sure the parish can help. | {h7_said=refuse} One can't help everyone, you understand. | {h7_said=refuse} Have you tried finding work? | {h7_said=refuse} I don't carry coin about with me.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_rich
when concept=want.answer self.wealth=rich
does give.advice
say {h7_said=give} A few pennies. Here. Don't mention it. | {h7_said=give} Perhaps I could find you some work. Something. | {h7_said=give} Here. Take this, and don't argue. | {h7_said=give} You should have come to me sooner. Here.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_comfortable
when concept=want.answer self.wealth=comfortable
does give.advice
say {h7_said=give} I can spare a little. Not much. Here. | {h7_said=give} I've a loaf at home. It's yours. | {h7_said=give} We're not flush ourselves, but here. | {h7_said=give} Here. It's not much, but it's yours.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_poor
when concept=want.answer self.wealth=poor|destitute
does give.advice
say {h7_said=same} I'd give you half if I had a whole. | {h7_said=same} We're in the same boat, you and I. Both bailing. | {h7_said=same} I've a turnip. A small one. It's yours. | {h7_said=same} If I had it, it'd be yours.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_sly
when concept=want.answer self.honesty=sly conv.wn=loan|hungry|owes|failing|robbed|dole
does give.advice
say {h7_said=sly} I could lend. At a fair rate. Very fair. | {h7_said=sly} I might know someone who pays for odd jobs. Don't ask what. | {h7_said=sly} What have you got to sell? | {h7_said=sly} There's always a way. If you're not fussy.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_frank
when concept=want.answer self.honesty=frank conv.wn=loan|owes|failing|dole
does give.advice
say {h7_said=scold} You should've come to me before it got this bad. | {h7_said=scold} You've known this was coming. So have I. | {h7_said=scold} I'll help. But you'll listen first. | {h7_said=scold} Pride got you here. Leave it at the door.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_devout
when concept=want.answer self.piety=devout
does give.advice
say {h7_said=pray} The chapel feeds anyone who asks. I'll take you. | {h7_said=pray} The Bright One tests the ones most loved. | {h7_said=pray} Pray with me. Then we'll find you bread. | {h7_said=pray} The Bright One sees. I'll speak to the chaplain.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_short
when concept=want.answer self.temper=short
does give.advice
say {h7_said=refuse} And what do you want me to do about it? | {h7_said=refuse} Everyone's got troubles. | {h7_said=refuse} Don't look at me. I've my own. | {h7_said=refuse} Then do something, don't moan.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_guard
when concept=want.answer self.role=guard conv.wn=hungry|dole|owes|homeless|loan|pups|old|failing
does give.advice
say {h7_said=duty} The captain wants porters at the watch post. It's work. | {h7_said=duty} Don't do anything stupid. I'd have to take you in. | {h7_said=duty} Go to the chapel before dark. Tell them I sent you. | {h7_said=duty} If anyone gives you trouble over it, you send for me.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_guard_robbed
when concept=want.answer self.role=guard conv.wn=robbed
does give.advice
say {h7_said=ask} Did you see who took it? Tell me everything. | {h7_said=ask} When was this? Where? | {h7_said=ask} Come by the watch post and we'll write it down.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_dry
when concept=want.answer self.humour=dry conv.wn=loan|hungry|dole|owes|failing|robbed|homeless
does give.advice
say {h7_said=joke} Cheer up. You can't get much poorer. | {h7_said=joke} At least you're not rich. All that worry. | {h7_said=joke} Look on the bright side. There isn't one. | {h7_said=joke} Think how thin you'll be.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_merchant_failing
when concept=want.answer self.role=merchant self.business=failing
does give.advice
say {h7_said=same} You and me both. I'm one bad week from the street. | {h7_said=same} I'd give you credit, if I had stock to give it on. | {h7_said=same} Nobody's buying. Nobody's eating. It's all one. | {h7_said=same} I can't help. I can't even help myself.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_baker
when concept=want.answer self.job=baker|cook conv.wn=hungry|dole|pups|homeless|old|robbed|loan
does give.advice
say {h7_said=give} There's ends at the back. Come by at dusk. | {h7_said=give} I've a loaf with a burnt bottom. It's yours. | {h7_said=give} I'll put something by. Don't tell the others. | {h7_said=give} Bread I've got. Coin I haven't.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_healer_hurt
when concept=want.answer self.job=healer conv.wn=hurt
does give.advice
say {h7_said=mend} Come and see me. No charge. Don't argue. | {h7_said=mend} Keep it still, keep it clean, and come to me tomorrow. | {h7_said=mend} I'll see to you. Pay me when you can. Or don't.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_healer
when concept=want.answer self.job=healer conv.wn=hungry|pups|dole|homeless
does give.advice
say {h7_said=give} Eat something before you fall. That's a healer's order. | {h7_said=give} Hunger's a sickness too. I'll send word to the chapel for you. | {h7_said=give} Come by mine. There's broth, and nobody counts the bowls.
then other: want.close

rule h7_wn_ans_old
when concept=want.answer self.stage=old
does give.advice
say {h7_said=old} I've been poorer. It passes. Mostly. | {h7_said=old} Eat what's there. Don't wait for what isn't. | {h7_said=old} We ate nettles one winter. Nettles! And lived. | {h7_said=old} Keep your chin up. And your tail down. Less to bite.
then other: want.close

############################################################################ Want: closes

rule h7_wn_close_any
when concept=want.close
does thank
say Aye. | Thank you for listening. | I'll manage. | Somehow.

rule h7_wn_close_give
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=give
does thank
say I... thank you. I'll not forget it. | You're too good to me. | I'll pay it back. Every penny. | I don't know what to say.

rule h7_wn_close_give_proud
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=give self.temper=short
does thank
say I'll take it. I hate taking it. Thank you. | Don't tell anyone. Please. | I'll pay it back. I will. Don't look at me like that.

rule h7_wn_close_refuse
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=refuse
does thank
say Right. Of course. | Forget I said anything. | I'll not ask again. | I see.

rule h7_wn_close_refuse_short
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=refuse self.temper=short
does thank
say Easy for you to say. | Keep your coin, then. Choke on it. | I'll remember that.

rule h7_wn_close_same
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=same
does thank
say Look at us. | Two of a kind. | We'll get through. Somehow. | At least we've got each other. And nothing else.

rule h7_wn_close_sly
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=sly
does thank
say I'm not that desperate. Yet. | What sort of jobs? | Never mind. Never mind. | I'd sooner starve honest.

rule h7_wn_close_scold
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=scold
does thank
say I know. I know. | Thank you. I think. | You're right. That's the worst part. | That's not help, that's a sermon.

rule h7_wn_close_pray
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=pray
does thank
say Bread first. Then the Bright One. | I'll go. Thank you. | The Bright One can test someone else. | If you'd come with me.

rule h7_wn_close_duty
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=duty
does thank
say I'll go. Thank you. | I'm not a thief. Not yet. | I'll go before dark. | I might. Thank you.

rule h7_wn_close_ask
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=ask
does thank
say It was too quick. I saw nothing. | Last night. By the well. | Everything I had. Everything.

rule h7_wn_close_joke
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=joke
does thank
say Ha. Thank you. I think. | That's cruel. And true. | You're no help at all. | I needed that. Bright One help me.

rule h7_wn_close_old
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=old
does thank
say #bc_ill_try# | It had better pass. | Easy said, at your age. | Aye. I suppose you've seen worse.

rule h7_wn_close_mend
when concept=want.close conv.h7_said=mend
does thank
say Thank you. I'll come tomorrow. | Bless you. I'll come. | You're a good soul.

############################################################################ Strangers: openers (talk.player; topic.subject is a name they were given, or "that grey stranger")

rule h7_st_open
when concept=talk.player topic.known=yes
does tell.gossip
say #topic.subject#'s about again. | Look. #topic.subject#. | Look who's back. #topic.subject#. | See #topic.subject# over there?
then other: stranger.answer

rule h7_st_open_unknown
when concept=talk.player topic.known=no
does tell.gossip
say Never seen #topic.subject# before. Have you? | #topic.subject# just walked in like #topic.they# owns the place. | What do you make of #topic.subject#? | Somebody new. #topic.subject#. Mind #topic.them#.
then other: stranger.answer

# What a resident overheard a stranger asking after in open chat (doc 84 §13.1.2, Phase 12: Game::overheard; topic.asked
# is the world's words, "asking the way to the Grey Gull", a quarter of a day): talked of, never quoted, never answered.
rule h7_st_open_asked
when concept=talk.player topic.asked
does tell.gossip
priority 2
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# was #topic.asked#, loud as you like. | Did you hear #topic.subject# just now? Was #topic.asked#, for all to hear. | #topic.subject#'s been #topic.asked#. Somebody ought to tell #topic.them#. | That one was #topic.asked#. Not shy, that one.
then other: stranger.answer

rule h7_st_open_hire
when concept=talk.player world.bandits=near self.wealth=comfortable|rich
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# looks handy. With the roads as they are. | I'd pay #topic.subject# to see my goods through. | Could #topic.subject# be hired, do you think? | Somebody like #topic.subject# could earn well this season.
then other: stranger.answer

rule h7_st_open_crime
when concept=talk.player world.crime=recent topic.known=no
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say Thefts in town, and #topic.subject# turns up. | Did #topic.subject# come before or after the robbery? | I'd watch #topic.subject#, with things going missing. | Who saw #topic.subject# come in? With all this thieving?
then other: stranger.answer

rule h7_st_open_guard
when concept=talk.player self.role=guard
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say I've been told to keep an eye on #topic.subject#. | #topic.subject#. Know anything? | Seen #topic.subject# making trouble? | I like to know who's in my streets. What about #topic.subject#?
then other: stranger.answer

rule h7_st_open_robbed
when concept=talk.player self.robbed=yes
does tell.gossip
tone serious
cooldown 12h
say Could #topic.subject# find who robbed me, do you think? | I keep looking at #topic.subject#. Since I was robbed, I look at everyone. | Travellers hear things. #topic.subject# might know who took my things. | Was #topic.subject# about when I was robbed?
then other: stranger.answer

rule h7_st_open_poor
when concept=talk.player self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.gossip
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# looks like #topic.they#'s coin. More than us. | Would #topic.subject# spare a penny, do you think? | I'd ask #topic.subject# for work. Any work. | Look at #topic.subject#'s boots. I could live a month on those boots.
then other: stranger.answer

############################################################################ Strangers: answers

rule h7_st_ans_any
when concept=stranger.answer
does react.news
say {h7_said=shrug} A traveller. Passing through. | {h7_said=shrug} Don't know. Don't care. | {h7_said=shrug} Who knows, with travellers. | {h7_said=shrug} #topic.they.capitalize# looks tired. | {h7_said=shrug} Let #topic.them# be.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_guard
when concept=stranger.answer self.role=guard
does react.news
say {h7_said=duty} I've my eye on #topic.them#. | {h7_said=duty} #topic.they.capitalize#'s caused no trouble. Yet. | {h7_said=duty} Came in by the gate. Asked the way. Polite. | {h7_said=duty} If #topic.they#'s trouble, #topic.they#'ll find me.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_nervy
when concept=stranger.answer self.temper=nervy
does react.news
say {h7_said=fear} I don't like #topic.them#. I don't like any of them. | {h7_said=fear} Don't look at #topic.them#. #topic.they.capitalize#'ll see us looking. | {h7_said=fear} Is #topic.they# armed? #topic.they.capitalize#'s armed. | {h7_said=fear} Let's go inside.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_merchant
when concept=stranger.answer self.role=merchant
does react.news
say {h7_said=trade} #topic.they.capitalize#'s got coin. Travellers always do. | {h7_said=trade} I'll give #topic.them# a good price. Good for me. | {h7_said=trade} Ask #topic.them# what #topic.they# needs. I've everything. | {h7_said=trade} Customers. That's what I see.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_warm
when concept=stranger.answer self.warmth=warm
does react.news
say {h7_said=kind} Someone should give #topic.them# a hot meal. | {h7_said=kind} #topic.they.capitalize# looks like #topic.they# could use a friend. | {h7_said=kind} I'll say good day. It costs nothing. | {h7_said=kind} Poor thing. Far from home.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_cold
when concept=stranger.answer self.warmth=cold self.honesty=guarded
does react.news
say {h7_said=fear} Strangers bring trouble. Always. | {h7_said=fear} I'll keep my door shut. | {h7_said=fear} Don't talk to #topic.them#. | {h7_said=fear} #topic.they.capitalize#'ll be gone soon. Good.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_ambitious
when concept=stranger.answer self.drive=ambitious|restless
does react.news
say {h7_said=envy} I'd like to see what #topic.they#'s seen. | {h7_said=envy} I wonder what #topic.they# earns. Out there. | {h7_said=envy} I could do what #topic.they# does. | {h7_said=envy} Lucky. Free as the wind.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_young
when concept=stranger.answer self.stage=young|adolescent
does react.news ask.detail
say {h7_said=young} Is #topic.they# a hero? | {h7_said=young} Has #topic.they# got a sword? Can I see? | {h7_said=young} I want to go and talk to #topic.them#! | {h7_said=young} Does #topic.they# fight #bandits#?
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_rich
when concept=stranger.answer self.wealth=rich
does react.news
say {h7_said=hire} One could find a use for someone like that. | {h7_said=hire} Perhaps #topic.they#'d take a position. | {h7_said=hire} #topic.they.capitalize# looks capable. One needs capable. | {h7_said=hire} Ask what #topic.they# charges.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_sly
when concept=stranger.answer self.honesty=sly
does react.news
say {h7_said=trade} Wonder what's in that pack. | {h7_said=trade} Strangers don't know the prices. Just saying. | {h7_said=trade} Find out what #topic.they# wants. Then sell it. | {h7_said=trade} #topic.they.capitalize#'ll know things. Things worth knowing.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_st_ans_devout
when concept=stranger.answer self.piety=devout
does react.news
say {h7_said=kind} We were all strangers somewhere once. | {h7_said=kind} The Bright One sends travellers to test us. | {h7_said=kind} I'll pray for #topic.their# road. | {h7_said=kind} #topic.they.capitalize# should come to the chapel. All are welcome.
then other: stranger.close

############################################################################ Strangers and deeds: closes

rule h7_st_close_any
when concept=stranger.close
does counter
say #bc_maybe# | #bc_we_will_see# | Aye. | Hm.

rule h7_st_close_shrug
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=shrug
does counter
say #bc_maybe# | #bc_we_will_see# | Aye. | Well. There #topic.they# goes.

rule h7_st_close_duty
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=duty
does counter
say Good. Keep it on #topic.them#. | Polite's how they start. | Good to know. | I'll sleep easier.

rule h7_st_close_fear
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=fear
does counter
say You're frightened of your own tail. | #topic.they.capitalize#'s just a traveller. | Calm down. #topic.they.capitalize#'ll hear you. | Fine. Inside.

rule h7_st_close_fear_nervy
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=fear self.temper=nervy
does counter
say You see it too? I'm not mad? | Inside. Now. Quickly. | I said so. I said so.

rule h7_st_close_trade
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=trade
does counter
say You'd sell your mother to a traveller. | Don't fleece #topic.them#. | Money, money. | Go on, then. Before someone else does.

rule h7_st_close_kind
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=kind
does counter
say You go and do it, then. | You're soft. | Good of you. | #topic.they.capitalize# might bite.

rule h7_st_close_envy
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=envy
does counter
say And sleep in ditches? | The wind gets cold. | You'd last a day. | Go, then. Write to us.

rule h7_st_close_young
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=young
does counter
say Ha. Maybe, pup. | You'll have to ask #topic.them#. | Calm down, little one. | One day, maybe.

rule h7_st_close_hire
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=hire
does counter
say Everyone can be bought. The question's how dear. | Then ask. | And trust #topic.them# how? | You'd hire the moon if it'd carry your parcels.

rule h7_st_close_admire
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=admire
does counter
say Good. We need more like that. | I'll buy #topic.them# a drink, if I see #topic.them#. | Let's hope it's catching. | So say we all.

rule h7_st_close_outdone
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=outdone
does counter
say Then ride out yourselves next time. | Sour suits you. | Somebody had to. | Ha. Jealous?

rule h7_st_close_pray
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=pray
does counter
say Bless #topic.them#, aye. | Thank #topic.them# too. Not just the Bright One. | The Bright One and a strong arm. | If you say so.

rule h7_st_close_doubt
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=doubt
does counter
say You'd doubt the sun. | Believe what you like. | Ask #topic.them#, then. | I believe it.

rule h7_st_close_doubt_frank
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=doubt self.honesty=frank
does counter
say I know the wolf who saw it. I'd trust that one with my life. | You weren't there. Nor was I. But I believe the ones who were.

rule h7_st_close_road
when concept=stranger.close conv.h7_said=road
does counter
say Aye. If only. | Someone should ask #topic.them#. | I'd chip in, if somebody asked.

############################################################################ Deeds: openers and answers (talk.deed: topic.subject, topic.deed, topic.nickname)

rule h7_dd_open
when concept=talk.deed
does tell.news
say You'll like this. #topic.subject# #topic.deed#. | Have you heard about #topic.subject#? #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.deed#. | Word is #topic.subject# #topic.deed#. | I heard #topic.subject# #topic.deed#.
then other: deed.answer

rule h7_dd_open_nickname
when concept=talk.deed topic.has_nickname=yes
does tell.news
say #topic.nickname#, they call #topic.them# now. Because #topic.they# #topic.deed#. | Heard of #topic.nickname#? That's #topic.subject#. #topic.they.capitalize# #topic.deed#. | #topic.subject# #topic.deed#. Folk call #topic.them# #topic.nickname# for it.
then other: deed.answer

rule h7_dd_open_poor
when concept=talk.deed self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say #topic.subject# #topic.deed#. Somebody's luck turned. | #topic.subject# #topic.deed#. Wish #topic.they#'d come down our street. | I heard #topic.subject# #topic.deed#. There's hope for some, then. | #topic.subject# #topic.deed#. Not for the likes of us, but still.
then other: deed.answer

rule h7_dd_ans_any
when concept=deed.answer
does react.news
say {h7_said=admire} Good for #topic.them#. | {h7_said=admire} That's something, these days. | {h7_said=admire} Did #topic.they#, now? | {h7_said=admire} Well, well.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_dd_ans_doubt
when concept=deed.answer self.honesty=guarded|sly
does react.news
say {h7_said=doubt} Says who? | {h7_said=doubt} I'll believe it when I see it. | {h7_said=doubt} Funny how nobody saw #topic.them# do it. | {h7_said=doubt} Nobody does that for nothing.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_dd_ans_warm
when concept=deed.answer self.warmth=warm
does react.news
say {h7_said=admire} Oh, that's lovely. That does my heart good. | {h7_said=admire} There are good folk left, then. | {h7_said=admire} I'd like to shake #topic.their# paw. | {h7_said=admire} That's the best thing I've heard all week.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_dd_ans_guard
when concept=deed.answer self.role=guard
does react.news
say {h7_said=outdone} Doing our job. Better than us, apparently. | {h7_said=outdone} Saves us a ride, I suppose. | {h7_said=outdone} Hmph. #topic.they.capitalize# should've left it to the Watch. | {h7_said=outdone} Well. I'll not complain.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_dd_ans_rich
when concept=deed.answer self.wealth=rich
does react.news
say {h7_said=hire} One should have #topic.them# to dinner. | {h7_said=hire} Someone like that is worth knowing. | {h7_said=hire} One might find #topic.them# a position. | {h7_said=hire} How admirable. How useful.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_dd_ans_devout
when concept=deed.answer self.piety=devout
does react.news
say {h7_said=pray} The Bright One works through such folk. | {h7_said=pray} I'll give thanks on Restday. | {h7_said=pray} That's the Bright One's paw in it. | {h7_said=pray} Bless #topic.them#. Bless #topic.them#.
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_dd_ans_young
when concept=deed.answer self.stage=young|adolescent
does react.news
say {h7_said=young} A hero! A real one! | {h7_said=young} I want to be like #topic.them# when I grow up! | {h7_said=young} Can we meet #topic.them#? Please? | {h7_said=young} Did #topic.they# have a sword?
then other: stranger.close

rule h7_dd_ans_bandits
when concept=deed.answer world.bandits=near
does react.news
say {h7_said=road} Now if #topic.they#'d do the same for the road. | {h7_said=road} Ask #topic.them# to have a go at the #bandits#. | {h7_said=road} We could use #topic.them# here. With the road as it is. | {h7_said=road} Someone like that, and the road might open.
then other: stranger.close

############################################################################ How they're keeping, in hard times (more answers to keeping.sorry and keeping.nod)
# keeping.sorry follows the other's own answer, which is about the worst thing they have (mourning, then a bad
# injury or no home, then a robbery, hunger, want or a failing business, then the dole or debts): each of these
# answers holds only when that is what the other will have spoken of.

rule h7_sorry_healer
when concept=keeping.sorry self.job=healer other.injured=bad other.mourning=no other.homeless=no
does sympathise
say Come by. Let me look at it properly. | Keep it clean and keep it still. I mean it. | That wants a poultice. Tonight. | You're walking on it? Sit down this instant.

rule h7_sorry_guard_robbed
when concept=keeping.sorry self.role=guard other.robbed=yes other.mourning=no other.injured!=bad other.homeless=no other.hungry=no other.wealth!=destitute other.business!=failing
does sympathise
say Tell me everything. Slowly. What, where, when. | We'll find them. Or I'll know why not. | Did you see their face? Their coat? Anything? | Come by the watch post. We'll write it down.

rule h7_sorry_priest_mourning
when concept=keeping.sorry self.job=priest other.mourning=kin|friend other.injured!=bad other.homeless=no
does sympathise
say Come to the chapel tonight. Just to sit. | They're at peace. You're the one I worry for. | Grief's the price of love. You paid it gladly. | I'll come by tomorrow. Leave the door on the latch.

rule h7_sorry_homeless_both
when concept=keeping.sorry self.homeless=yes other.homeless=yes other.mourning=no other.injured!=bad
does sympathise
say There's a dry spot under the granary eaves. Room for two. | Stay near me tonight. It's warmer, two. | The chapel porch, if we're quick. | We'll find somewhere. We always do.

rule h7_sorry_hungry_both
when concept=keeping.sorry self.hungry=yes other.hungry=yes other.mourning=no other.injured!=bad other.homeless=no other.robbed=no
does sympathise
say Me too. My belly's been arguing all day. | We'll find something. Together. | Two empty pots. | Don't talk about it. It makes it worse.

rule h7_sorry_rich_cold_dole
when concept=keeping.sorry self.wealth=rich self.warmth=cold other.on_dole=yes other.mourning=no other.injured!=bad other.robbed=no other.homeless=no
does sympathise
say Well. That's what the parish is for. | One does give to the chapel, you know. | I'm sure it's only temporary. | Hm. Quite.

rule h7_sorry_dole_both
when concept=keeping.sorry self.on_dole=yes other.on_dole=yes other.mourning=no other.injured!=bad other.robbed=no other.homeless=no
does sympathise
say I'll save you a place in the line. | See you at the chapel door, then. | At least the line's good company. | Bring a sack. They've turnips Restday.

rule h7_sorry_owes_both
when concept=keeping.sorry self.owes=yes other.owes=yes other.mourning=no other.injured!=bad other.robbed=no other.homeless=no other.hungry=no other.wealth!=destitute other.business!=failing other.on_dole=no
does sympathise
say Same lender? | We should hide together. Cheaper. | I owe too. We'll go down together. | Don't answer the door. That's my advice.

rule h7_nod_fought_short
when concept=keeping.nod self.temper=short other.fought=yes other.injured!=light
does ack
say Who was it? Tell me who. | Did you win, at least? | Next time, call me first. | I'd have finished it for you.

############################################################################ Reactions and barks, in hard times

rule h7_react_theft_poor
when concept=react.theft wealth=poor|destitute
does aside
say Good luck to them. ... I never said that. | Run, you fool! Run! | There's a hungry one. | Ha. Not my purse, for once.

rule h7_react_theft_rich
when concept=react.theft wealth=rich
does aside
say Stop them! Somebody stop them! Where's the Watch? | Outrageous! In broad day! | My purse. Is it... yes. Thank the Bright One. | Thief! Guard! Anyone!

rule h7_react_theft_merchant
when concept=react.theft role=merchant
does aside
say My stock! Was it my stock? | Watch your stalls! Thief about! | Paws off! Paws off the goods! | That's the third this week!

rule h7_react_theft_nervy
when concept=react.theft temper=nervy
does aside
say Oh, Bright One. Oh, Bright One. Is everyone all right? | I knew it. I knew today was a bad day. | Somebody do something! Not me! | My heart. My heart.

rule h7_react_fight_old
when concept=react.fight stage=old
does aside
say In my day we fought fair. Mostly. | Young fools. Break it up! | I'd have had them both, forty years ago. | Mind my stick! Mind it!

rule h7_react_fight_merchant
when concept=react.fight role=merchant
does aside
say Not near the stall! Not near the stall! | Take it outside! This is outside. Take it further! | Who's paying for that? Who's paying? | Mind the goods, you brutes!

rule h7_react_fight_devout
when concept=react.fight piety=devout
does aside
say Bright One forgive them. Stop! | Peace! In the Bright One's name, peace! | Brothers! Sisters! Stop! | The Bright One sees you!

rule h7_react_fight_dry
when concept=react.fight humour=dry
does aside
say Lovely. Entertainment. | Two pennies on the short one. | Ah. The evening's begun. | Somebody fetch a bucket. Of water. Or ale.

rule h7_react_struck_light
when concept=react.struck injured=light
does aside
say Ow! Right. Right! | That'll mark. | You'll pay for that. | Lucky. That was lucky.

rule h7_bark_watch_crime
when concept=bark on_watch=yes world.crime=recent
does aside
cooldown 3h
say Keep your purses close, all! | Thieves about. Mind yourselves! | Anyone seen anything, you come to me. | Bolt your doors tonight, folks.

rule h7_bark_watch_bandits
when concept=bark on_watch=yes world.bandits=near here.place=gate
does aside
cooldown 3h
say Nobody out past the milestones after dusk! | Travelling? In company only. Hear me? | Gate shuts early tonight. Road's not safe. | Mind the road out there. Mind it well.

rule h7_bark_merchant_bandits
when concept=bark role=merchant world.bandits=near here.place=market
does aside
cooldown 6h
say Buy now! Next cart may never come! | Last of the stock till the road's clear! | Prices are the road's fault, not mine! | Get it while there's some to get!

rule h7_bark_destitute_beg
when concept=bark wealth=destitute here.place=street|market|gate|chapel
does aside
cooldown 6h
say Spare a penny? Half a penny? | A crust, anyone? For the Bright One's sake. | Anything at all. Anything. | Bless you. Bless you all. Anyone?

rule h7_bark_destitute_beg_rest
when concept=bark wealth=destitute here.day=rest here.place=chapel|street
does aside
cooldown 1d
priority 1
say Restday, friends. A penny for the Bright One's sake. | Show the Bright One your kindness. A penny. | Bless you, bless your Restday. A crust?

rule h7_bark_death_recent
when concept=bark world.death=recent here.place=street|chapel
does aside
cooldown 1d
say Bright One rest them. | Quiet street today. | Still can't believe it. | The bell's still in my ears.

rule h7_bark_crime_nervy
when concept=bark world.crime=recent temper=nervy
does aside
cooldown 6h
say Who's that? Oh. Just a cat. | Is that my purse? It's my purse. Good. | I'll be home before the lamps. Before. | Don't look behind. Don't look behind.

rule h7_bark_owes_lender
when concept=bark owes=yes here.place=street|market
does aside
cooldown 1d
say If that's the lender, I'm not here. | Head down. Head down. Walk. | Restday. I'll pay Restday. Or the next. | Not that way. They live that way.
